  "conclusions": [
    "SFT pass@1+7.1296pp vs control, paired95%CI[4.1667,10.0926]pp. Best observed pass@1:76.5741%. One training seed only.",
    "GRPO40steps yields-0.0926pp vs control; paired95%CI[-1.7593,1.5764]pp. No improvement demonstrated, not equivalence proof.",
    "Hybrid pass@1+4.4444pp vs control,95%CI[0.8333,7.7801]pp; vs GRPO+4.5370pp,95%CI[1.1111,7.8704]pp. This supports observed aggregate route difference on these problems, not controlled compute efficiency.",
    "Pass@3: control84.1667%,GRPO84.1667%,SFT86.1111%,hybrid86.9444%. All trained-route delta-control intervals include zero; hybrid-GRPO pass3CI also includes zero.",
    "Hybrid is2.6852pp below full-budget SFT in observed pass@1; no paired confidence interval for that contrast was computed. Not evidence that RL improved the SFT starting policy: that starting checkpoint only has36x1 curves, not full360x3.",
    "Fixed36task curves: control.6111; SFT .7222/.7500/.6944/.7222; GRPO .5833/.6389/.5556/.6111; hybrid initialSFT.7222 then .6667/.7222/.6667/.6944. No sustained RL learning trend; do not mix these denominators with full endpoints.",
    "SFT loss first10mean.40667 to last10mean.10865, with0.44854epoch reached. Train loss is different data/objective from validation; this alone cannot diagnose global overfitting.",
    "SFT numeric errors314->245 and unparsed16->8. Hybrid numeric errors314->278 and unparsed16->4. Aggregate improvements exceed parser coverage changes; no unit-class errors at endpoints. Requested-unit success and numerical equivalence use all1080responses.",
    "SFT gains strongest in density/pressure/speed/voltage while energy medium/hard and luminosity decline. Corpus quality filtering retained1076density/910pressure/702speed/424voltage/154energy/96luminosity. Consistent with selective degradation, no causal attribution without controlled balancing ablation.",
    "RL signal: GRPO20mixed/15all1/5all0 across40physicalproblems and18cells; hybrid12mixed/16all1/3all0 across31physicalproblems and16cells. Same first31prompts: GRPO16mixed/11all1/4all0. SFT prior increases saturation in this prefix, but train-reward averages are not heldout quality.",
